  "description": "A comprehensive .NET cryptography library built on BouncyCastle.Cryptography, providing block ciphers (AES, DES, Blowfish, ...), stream ciphers (ChaCha20, Salsa20), RSA public-key cryptography, post-quantum cryptography (ML-DSA, ML-KEM), X.509 certificates (generation, CSR, issuance, PFX, chain validation), hashing (SHA-2, SHA-3), HMAC (SHA-1/256/512), one-time passwords (HOTP, TOTP, otpauth provisioning), key derivation (PBKDF2, Argon2), padding schemes, and data encoding utilities (Base64, hex, Base32).",
